<Slide notes={`第三个结果：校准对象。实际部署的是 15 个模型的平均，定宽度时却用单个折模型的误差，等于量 A 的尺寸、衣服给 B 穿。受控实验其他全部对齐、只换校准残差，宽度省 2.7% 到 10.8%，均值 5.4%。但符号随舰队翻转，四个水平每个至少一个舰队反向，所以不够给方法排序。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>用折模型校准、却部署集成，宽度多付 2.7–10.8%</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F7' }}>03 · 结果</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, height: 504, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 18, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>控制变量：同骨干、同测试机、同中心、同 σ、同尾部，只换校准残差。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 360, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 620, height: 360, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Image src='assets/fig_object.png' style={{ width: 620, height: 360, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 508, height: 360, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>FINDING 03</Text>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12, marginTop: 2 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 68, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>5.4%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', marginBottom: 8 }}>四舰队平均宽度节省</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 12 }} />
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>部署对象</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>15 模型均值</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>校准对象</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>每台发动机一个干净分数</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>四舰队变化</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>−4.5 / −3.7 / −10.8 / −2.7%</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 18 }}>符号随舰队翻转：四个名义水平上，每个水平至少一个舰队反转。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 48, marginTop: 16, borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 16, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>效应真实，但不足以支撑方法排序。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 20, height: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>RUL 区间测量学 · 课题组进展汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>06 / 10</Text>
  </Box>
